<par def='2'><run><font size='12pt' style='bold underline' name='Arial' pitch='variable'
 truetype='true' familyid='20' color='blue'/>The "Add New Employee To Orders" button</run></par>
<par def='2'/>
<par def='2'>This button is used when you want an employee to be able to view orders that were created PRIOR to his/her being granted access to the database.</par>
